#: ../../configuration.md:1
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configurazione"

#: ../../configuration.md:3
msgid ""
"Worker tuning is done via `TASK_WORKER_*` environment variables. All of "
"them have sane defaults for local development — set them in production as"
" needed."
msgstr ""
"La configurazione del worker avviene tramite variabili d'ambiente "
"`TASK_WORKER_*`. Tutte hanno valori predefiniti ragionevoli per lo "
"sviluppo locale — impostale in produzione secondo necessità."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Variabile"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Predefinito"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Scopo"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Threads processing tasks in parallel."
msgstr "Thread che elaborano task in parallelo."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_STALE_MINUTES`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_STALE_MINUTES`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`5`"
msgstr "`5`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"A task stuck `RUNNING` (worker crash/OOM) is recovered to `READY` after "
"this many minutes."
msgstr ""
"Una task bloccata in `RUNNING` (crash/OOM del worker) viene ripristinata "
"a `READY` dopo questo numero di minuti."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_BACKOFF_BASE_S`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_BACKOFF_BASE_S`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`30`"
msgstr "`30`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Base delay for exponential backoff between retries."
msgstr "Ritardo base del backoff esponenziale tra i retry."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_HEARTBEAT_S`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_HEARTBEAT_S`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Fallback polling interval while waiting on `LISTEN`/`NOTIFY` (covers "
"deferred tasks whose `run_after` has just elapsed)."
msgstr ""
"Intervallo di polling di riserva mentre si attende su `LISTEN`/`NOTIFY` "
"(copre le task differite il cui `run_after` è appena scaduto)."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_DB_ALIAS`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_DB_ALIAS`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`\"default\"`"
msgstr "`\"default\"`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Which `DATABASES` alias the worker connects through. Point this at a "
"separate alias (with its own pool sized for `TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY + "
"1`) if you don't want the worker sharing a connection pool with your web "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Quale alias di `DATABASES` usa il worker per connettersi. Puntalo a un "
"alias separato (con un proprio pool dimensionato per "
"`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY + 1`) se non vuoi che il worker condivida il "
"connection pool con il tuo processo web."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_SPAN_PREFIX`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_SPAN_PREFIX`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`\"django_task_psql\"`"
msgstr "`\"django_task_psql\"`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Prefix for OpenTelemetry span names (`<prefix>.<task_path>`). Only "
"relevant if the `otel` extra is installed."
msgstr ""
"Prefisso per i nomi degli span OpenTelemetry (`<prefix>.<task_path>`). "
"Rilevante solo se l'extra `otel` è installato."

#: ../../configuration.md:14
msgid ""
"A CLI flag (`--concurrency`, `--queues`) always overrides its "
"corresponding environment variable."
msgstr ""
"Un flag da CLI (`--concurrency`, `--queues`) ha sempre la precedenza "
"sulla corrispondente variabile d'ambiente."
